This utility formats all bin and lib files of the current crate using rustfmt.

Usage: cargo fmt [OPTIONS] [-- <rustfmt_options>...]

Arguments:
  [rustfmt_options]...  Options passed to rustfmt

Options:
  -q, --quiet
          No output printed to stdout
